 "snippet": "    // L7 — THE MOAT. One gate, plugged. Crossing on foot costs everything.\n    make(\n      7,\n      [\n        king(3, 8), pawn(2, 6), bishop(8, 6),\n      ],\n      {\n        ...FLEE,\n        moveLimit: 9,\n        hazards: [X(1, 4), X(3, 4), X(4, 4), X(5, 4), X(6, 4), X(7, 4), X(8, 4), X(2, 3), X(2, 5), X(2, 8), X(5, 8)],\n        kingPen: ['c7', 'd7', 'c8', 'd8'],\n      },\n    ),"
